# The Linux release the driver layer compiles against (design-decisions 1578).
#
# `scripts/linux-tree.sh` fetches exactly this tarball and refuses any other
# content. Moving the pin is one commit: the version, the hash, and whatever
# the boot test then says about every driver. The hash is the one kernel.org
# publishes in https://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v6.x/sha256sums.asc
# (a PGP-signed file); once committed, this line is the trust anchor.
version 6.18.59
